<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= gleam_os_command_output (command : string) : string =\n    := output = erlang_term::apply \"os\" \"cmd\" [ erlang_term::charlist command ]\n    erlang_term::apply \"unicode\" \"characters_to_binary\" [ output ] |> erlang_term::cast\n\n:= os_command_output (command : string) : string =\n    run_target \\|\n        | Gleam => \\ () => gleam_os_command_output command\n        | _ => \\ () => no_arm \"os_command_output\"","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := gleam_os_command_output (command : string) : string =
      := output = erlang_term::apply "os" "cmd" [ erlang_term::charlist command ]
      erlang_term::apply "unicode" "characters_to_binary" [ output ] |> erlang_term::cast

  := os_command_output (command : string) : string =
      run_target \|
          | Gleam => \ () => gleam_os_command_output command
          | _ => \ () => no_arm "os_command_output"
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### an_os_command_returns_its_output (test)

